{"attack":"积蓄力量，提高自己的防御和特防。最多积蓄3次。","description":"陷入蓄力状态，在蓄力的时候，防御和特防会提高。\n令使用者的防御提升1级。\n令使用者的特防提升1级。\n储存的力量可以被喷出和吞下，这个情况下，通过储存招式提升的能力将恢复原状。最多可以储存3次力量，但若自身离开场地则储存的力量会消失。如果无法提升能力，依然可以储存力量。但如果已经储存了3次力量，则无法继续使用蓄力提升能力。\n如果使用接棒，能力提升可以传递，但储存的力量不会传递。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Ekans","Level":25},{"Name":"Arbok","Level":27},{"Name":"Jigglypuff","Level":12},{"Name":"Wigglytuff","Level":0},{"Name":"Snorlax","Level":0},{"Name":"Lanturn","Level":0},{"Name":"Qwilfish","Level":40},{"Name":"Qwilfish form:hisuian","Level":40},{"Name":"Pelipper","Level":28},{"Name":"Mawile","Level":16},{"Name":"Gulpin","Level":28},{"Name":"Swalot","Level":30},{"Name":"Lileep","Level":41},{"Name":"Cradily","Level":43},{"Name":"Drifloon","Level":24},{"Name":"Drifblim","Level":24},{"Name":"Munchlax","Level":20},{"Name":"Carnivine","Level":37},{"Name":"Trubbish","Level":21},{"Name":"Garbodor","Level":21},{"Name":"Heatmor","Level":20},{"Name":"Komala","Level":6},{"Name":"Guzzlord","Level":5},{"Name":"Skwovet","Level":15},{"Name":"Greedent","Level":15},{"Name":"Cramorant","Level":0},{"Name":"Overqwil","Level":40}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Rattata form:alolan","Raticate form:alolan","Victreebel","Seel","Dewgong","Grimer","Grimer form:alolan","Muk","Muk form:alolan","Koffing","Weezing","Weezing form:galarian","Wooper","Wooper form:paldean","Quagsire","Slugma","Magcargo","Numel","Camerupt","Seviper","Spheal","Sealeo","Walrein","Turtwig","Grotle","Torterra","Shellos form:east","Shellos form:west","Gastrodon form:east","Gastrodon form:west","Hippopotas","Hippowdon","Mareanie","Toxapex","Dewpider","Araquanid","Sandygast","Palossand","Lechonk","Oinkologne form:male","Oinkologne form:female","Wattrel","Kilowattrel","Clodsire"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Victreebel","Seel","Dewgong","Grimer","Grimer form:alolan","Muk","Koffing","Weezing","Wooper","Quagsire","Slugma","Magcargo","Numel","Camerupt","Seviper","Turtwig","Grotle","Torterra","Clodsire"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMo